<title>USA: Zeneca declines comment on stock activity.</title>
<headline>Zeneca declines comment on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said that Zeneca Group Plc has declined comment on its recent unusual market activity on the NYSE.</p>
<p>The NYSE said Zeneca cited company policy in declining to comment.</p>
<p>Zeneca's stock was up 4-1/2 at 91-1/2 in afternoon trading on the NYSE.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
